abel\">Genre</th><td class=\"infobox-data category hlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jazz\" title=\"Jazz\">Jazz</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Length</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><span class=\"duration\"><span class=\"min\">39</span>:<span class=\"s\">59</span></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Labels</th><td class=\"infobox-data hlist\">Dawn<br /><small>DLP 1116</small></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Producer</th><td class=\"infobox-data hlist\">Chuck Darwin</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header description\" style=\"color: #202122;background-color: lightsteelblue\"><a href=\"/wiki/Randy_Weston\" title=\"Randy Weston\">Randy Weston</a> chronology</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" style=\"color:inherit; background: transparent; width: 100%; min-width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; display: inline-table;\">\n\n<tbody><tr style=\"line-height: 1.4em;\">\n<td style=\"width: 33%; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; padding: .2em .1em .2em 0\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Jazz_%C3%A0_la_Bohemia\" title=\"Jazz à la Bohemia\">Jazz à la Bohemia</a></i><br />(1956)\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33%; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; padding: .2em .1em\"><i><b>The Modern Art of Jazz by Randy Weston</b></i><br />(1957)\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33%; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; padding: .2em 0 .2em .1em\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Piano_%C3%A1_la_Mode\" title=\"Piano á la Mode\">Piano á la Mode</a></i><br />(1957)\n</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><i><b>The Modern Art of Jazz by Randy Weston</b></i> (also released as <i><b>How High the Moon</b></i>) is a jazz album by American pianist <a href=\"/wiki/Randy_Weston\" title=\"Randy Weston\">Randy Weston</a> recorded in 1956 and released on the <a href=\"/wiki/Dawn_Records_(American_label)\" title=\"Dawn Records (American label)\">Dawn</a> label.<sup id=\"cit